#
# trivy config findings accepted for deploy/terraform (make tf-lint).
# Each is a false positive for how these modules are CALLED; see the reasons.

# AKS API server IP ranges are variable-driven: a validation refuses a public
# API server without api_server_authorized_ip_ranges (aks-platform).
AZU-0041

# Reported against the upstream terraform-aws-modules/eks defaults. Our call
# sets endpoint_public_access_cidrs, and a validation refuses 0.0.0.0/0 or an
# empty list while the endpoint is public (eks-platform).
AWS-0040
AWS-0041

# Upstream eks module: node egress to 0.0.0.0/0, needed for image pulls and
# AWS APIs through the NAT gateways (S3 goes through the gateway endpoint).
AWS-0104
